    description: "Follow-up from WI-zakub mini trial (notebookjournal_04172026_0210.md). With default rust-analyzer config, SCIP does NOT emit macro-expanded items as separate symbols — only the invocation occurrence at original source location. Check whether enabling procMacro.enable=true (via scip --config-path) changes this. If yes, the wasm_bindgen/napi/tauri_ipc linker story improves materially; if no, those linkers must keep per-macro pattern code."  # a12d
    fields: {}  # a12d
